{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790967568,"nonce":"VMRxIPw3+Quv6Lp8Qy6qcAEhIzo=","title":"number_input has no keyboard stepping","message":"Up and down arrows should step the value. They do not.\n\n`text_input`'s `on_key_down` already owns the keyboard for cursor,\nselection and clipboard, and forking it for the number case needs an\nescape hatch that does not exist yet.\n\nToday a caller steps the value through `NumberInputBuilder::step` plus\n`cn::number_input`'s `+` and `-` buttons, or any button of their own\ncalling `step_up` / `step_down`.","files":null}]}